  (label "OLED_BTN" (at 302.26 96.52 180) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid "6f882d2a-39ba-546d-96e3-d53e51a2e502"))
  (wire (pts (xy 312.42 99.06) (xy 302.26 99.06)) (stroke (width 0) (type solid)) (uuid "f7be2307-f1eb-5b3c-8718-a9e63a7d50c8"))
  (label "GND" (at 302.26 99.06 180) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid "8b5e63b2-5819-59bc-a41b-4d592b7d92e0"))
  (text "Same net label = connected. Net-label schematic, not a routed harness: move the blocks to taste in KiCad."
    (at 43.18 149.86 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left)) (uuid "1136411b-71c7-5e19-bcae-a1fd37e80b38"))
  (text "One I2C master: the FireBeetle owns I2C_SDA/I2C_SCL (3.3 V). Do not connect that bus to the Pi; fit one set of pull-ups only."
    (at 43.18 160.02 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left)) (uuid "17bbeefb-7002-5305-8322-e3f487d2f3ca"))
  (text "One 8.4 V input, centre-positive. The 16 mm switch is latching (C/NO) and sits in the charge lead; its LED is fed from UPS_5V, not from 8.4 V."
    (at 43.18 170.18 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left)) (uuid "5038803d-441a-531a-9430-a47ddceea648"))
  (text "UPS_5V and GND reach the Pi on soldered 20-22 AWG wires (no pogo pins). USB_FB_SERIAL is a data-only USB cable (VBUS cut)."
    (at 43.18 180.34 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left)) (uuid "7548c838-8780-55c4-867b-3952256a52c8"))
  (text "BATT_2S_P carries the 5 A BLX-A fuse. CHG_SENSE taps CHG_8V4 (the HAT side of the switch) through 30k/10k, 100 nF to GND."
    (at 43.18 190.50 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left)) (uuid "823fb68a-eda7-5de2-ae12-0a9b116c5758"))
  (text "USB_KEYBOARD is the K06's 2.4 GHz dongle in a Pi USB-A, or nothing at all when the keyboard runs over Bluetooth."
    (at 43.18 200.66 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left)) (uuid "45b88da8-fb17-51e7-9ed8-b265e23c8b45"))
  (sheet_instances
    (path "/" (page "1"))
  )
